    [4910]={name="Painted Chain Gloves",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hunt Begins” — pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Begins",lore="You have a promising air about you, and will prove yourself to the tribe. Perhaps someday soon you will be welcomed into the great city of Thunder Bluff."},
    [4911]={name="Thick Bark Buckler",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Attack on Camp Narache”. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="Attack on Camp Narache",lore="After carefully evaluating the map, you realize that what you discovered are the plans made by the Bristleback warchief for an extended siege on Camp Narache."},
    [4913]={name="Painted Chain Belt",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Hunt Continues” — pick it over the other choices. In Red Cloud Mesa.",zone="Red Cloud Mesa",questName="The Hunt Continues",lore="A tauren skilled in the ways of the hunt knows that his prey is not for mere trophy. The beasts of the plains provide us with a means of survival."},
    [4917]={name="Battleworn Chain Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Sarkoth” — pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Sarkoth",lore="Seeing the deed you have done for me steels my heart. I cannot fall so easily! I must endure! But it remains that I cannot make the trek back to the Den unassisted."},
    [4922]={name="Jagged Chain Vest",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Burning Blade Medallion” — pick it over the other choices. In Valley of Trials.",zone="Valley of Trials",questName="Burning Blade Medallion",lore="Through my divinations, I see that an item of power hides deep within the Burning Blade Coven, guarded by beasts and black magic. It is called the Burning Blade Medallion, and your next task is to find it and remove it from the coven."},
    [4935]={name="Wide Metal Girdle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “From The Wreckage....” — pick it over the other choices. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="From The Wreckage....",lore="One of my most observant scouts brings back word that the wreckage of Proudmoore's fleet still remains off the coast of Durotar, just east of Tiragarde Keep."},
    [4939]={name="Steady Bastard Sword",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Skull Rock” — pick it over the other choices. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="Skull Rock",lore=". The Burning Blade has infested the cave east of Orgrimmar known as Skull Rock. Inside that cave they perform vile rituals, and burn their own flesh with Searing Collars."},
    [4946]={name="Lightweight Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Zalazane” — pick it over the other choices. In Durotar.",zone="Durotar",questName="Zalazane",lore="The witchdoctor Zalazane dwells on the Echo Isles to the east. They are the isles we once called home. From there he sends his trolls to the mainland, to hex our people and drag more of them under his sway."},
    [4964]={name="Goblin Smasher",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Supervisor Fizsprocket” — pick it over the other choices. In Mulgore.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Supervisor Fizsprocket",lore="According to the documents you salvaged from the caravan, the Venture Co. created many plans to attempt to drive us from our lands here, so that they could have free reign to plunder our lands."},
    [4969]={name="Fortified Bindings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Dwarven Digging” — pick it over the other choices. In Mulgore.",zone="Mulgore",questName="Dwarven Digging",lore="There are dwarves preparing a dig site to the northwest. They think secrets lie in the earth, and that is true, but hollowing and defiling the land is no way to earn its teachings."},
    [4975]={name="Vigilant Buckler",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Malin's Request” — pick it over the other choices. In Arathi Highlands.",zone="Arathi Highlands",questName="Malin's Request",lore="Take this letter back to Stormwind and let Malin know that Kryten an' I'll be home soon. He'll reward you well for helping us here, of that I've no doubt."},
    [4998]={name="Blood Ring",sourceType="world_drop",instructions="World drop — drops from 363 creature types around level 19-26. Also found on the auction house."},
