    [15404]={name="Breakwater Girdle",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “WANTED: Murkdeep!” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="WANTED: Murkdeep!",lore="Attention! A reward is being offered for the death of the murloc \"Murkdeep\"."},
    [15406]={name="Crustacean Boots",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Fruit of the Sea” — pick it over the other choices. In Darkshore.",zone="Darkshore",questName="Fruit of the Sea",lore="I love crab. Crabs are the fruit of the sea! You can bake it, barbecue it, boil it, and broil it. They're pan fried, deep fried, and stir fried."},
    [15413]={name="Ornate Adamantium Breastplate",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “In Dreams” — pick it over the other choices. In Western Plaguelands.",zone="Western Plaguelands",questName="In Dreams",lore="For so long, I have been a puppet of the Grand Crusader. What reason was there to fight against what the Scarlet Crusade had become?"},
    [15424]={name="Axe of Orgrimmar",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Hidden Enemies” — pick it over the other choices. In Orgrimmar.",zone="Orgrimmar",questName="Hidden Enemies",lore="You are one of my lieutenants! Prepare yourself. I will call upon you soon. My time spent on the Searing Blade may be all but wasted now, but that does not mean that the Shadow Council's schemes elsewhere must suffer."},
    [15451]={name="Gargoyle Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “The Power to Destroy...” — pick it over the other choices. In Ragefire Chasm.",zone="Ragefire Chasm",questName="The Power to Destroy...",lore="Many denizens of the Legion bestow gifts on their followers as you may well know. Some of these gifts the Dark Lady feels would be better off in her hands than in the hands of those with..."},
    [15459]={name="Grimtoll Wristguards",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Grimtotem Spying” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Grimtotem Spying",lore="you have served us well in the past, so I now entrust to you an important mission. The Grimtotem Clan is up to something secretive. Three agents of unknown origin were seen visiting the Grimtotem over the recent weeks."},
    [15466]={name="Clink Shield",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Arikara” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Arikara",lore="Take this refined and purified Incendia powder to Thousand Needles and toss it on the sacred fire of life. It is located in the Darkcloud Pinnacle on an isolated needle where they bury their dead."},
    [15470]={name="Plainsguard Leggings",sourceType="quest_reward",instructions="Reward from the quest “Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem” — pick it over the other choices. In Thousand Needles.",zone="Thousand Needles",questName="Wanted - Arnak Grimtotem",lore="Wanted: Arnak Grimtotem Arnak the outcast is wanted for the heinous crimes of murder and kidnapping. Handsome rewards will be given to those brave enough to bring this criminal to justice."},
